Fix path traversal in Assets.read (CWE-22)

The ASSET verb joined the requested name onto the asset root and opened the
result, so "../" sequences read files outside the asset directory.
Assets.read now canonicalises the joined path with getCanonicalPath() and
refuses any path that does not start with the asset root before opening
it; the check runs on every path to the open, so a traversal cannot reach
the file.
